  "notes": [
    "Preregistered implementation gate: tests must prove policy-only replay is accepted without Action-Q architecture, Q replay loss is not evaluated at coefficient zero, soft-policy loss changes policy logits, and Q-enabled legacy behavior remains valid. Strict dataset merge and loader audit must show 10,752 rows, all BB/SB x flop/turn x five trajectory strata, paired anchor-action uncertainty, held-out train/validation/test split, and immutable SHA256. A 4,096-hand smoke must show positive finite soft-policy loss, exactly one replay batch, finite PPO metrics, no KL stop, and terminal audit PASS. Production only on PASS; four-checkpoint seed20260853 paired curve versus untouched control; no Slumbot without robust direction-consistent evidence.",
    "Policy-only decoupling tests PASS 2/2: soft replay backpropagates into policy logits without any Action-Q interface/head and advances the deterministic replay cursor exactly once per batch.",
    "Dataset gate PASS: strict full-schema merge produced immutable SHA256 605a7ab8...efb8e with 10,752 rows. Live loader produced 6,454 train / 2,149 validation / 2,149 test rows; all 20 seat-street-trajectory strata were nonempty in every split; paired-CRN advantage LCB z=1.96 and conservative five-continuation uncertainty were active.",
    "Smoke gate PASS at 4,103 actual hands: policy-only soft loss was finite and positive (0.2573), counterfactual Q loss exactly zero, Action-Q architecture disabled, exactly one 512-row replay batch applied, source KL 0.00008367, zero clip/stop, and fixed-pool terminal audit PASS.",
    "Policy-only replay auditor validated on the completed one-update smoke evidence while the untouched production session continued; no training source, checkpoint, optimizer, or cursor was modified.",
    "Production completed without interruption at 263,417 actual hands. Fixed-pool assignment/session audit and policy-only replay cursor/decay audit both passed before any frozen evaluation."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "Policy-only uncertainty-conservative counterfactual replay completed valid smoke and 263,417-hand production, but its frozen matched curve had only 5/12 positive deltas, mean -0.414 and median -0.229 bb/100, with every paired interval crossing zero.",
    "conclusion": "The treatment is mechanically valid and stable but did not robustly improve general strength over the untouched adaptive-league all-heads control at this dataset size and coefficient.",
    "decision": "REJECT_COUNTERFACTUAL_SOFT_POLICY_NO_ROBUST_GENERAL_GAIN",
    "next_step": "Select a materially broader learned-policy data or optimization intervention; do not scale this small offline counterfactual treatment unchanged and do not spend Slumbot hands on it."
  },
